  "claims": {
    "coherence": "Constructive Four witness between every pair of parallel pure-wiring Cell paths in the newly defined normalization-relative higher completion.",
    "generators": "Eight root-normalization squares and three constructor-normalization forms; eight structural law forms. No arbitrary parallel-path generator.",
    "boundary": "One root-square schema has expanded left boundary 4*depth+3, unbounded even for one input and one output. This does not exclude another bounded presentation.",
    "live_game": "Both orders of independent pure-wiring edits lift to the same continuing MAC game with one shared cache and original remaining caller.",
    "cost": "Equivalent Cell paths can have 43 and 45 expanded root occurrences; this metric is not invariant under Four."
  },
